WEBVTT

00:01:27.893 --> 00:01:31.091
She created a new culture
of social activism.

00:01:31.761 --> 00:01:35.018
Pete Seeger said it was Septima Clark
who changed the lyrics

00:01:35.042 --> 00:01:36.627
to the old gospel song

00:01:36.651 --> 00:01:38.736
and made the anthem we all know:

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.401
"We Shall Overcome."

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.678
Vanessa Garrison: Now,
many of you may know us.

00:01:43.702 --> 00:01:46.179
We are the cofounders of GirlTrek,

00:01:46.203 --> 00:01:49.932
the largest health organization
for Black women in America.

00:01:50.335 --> 00:01:51.675
Our mission is simple:

00:01:52.292 --> 00:01:53.978
ask Black women,

00:01:54.609 --> 00:01:57.537
80 percent of whom are over
a healthy body weight,

00:01:57.561 --> 00:02:00.910
to walk outside
of their front door every day